Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.60,0:00:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:07.40,0:00:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.80,0:00:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.00,0:00:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.20,0:00:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.90,0:00:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.30,0:00:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.50,0:00:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.80,0:01:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.30,0:01:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.30,0:01:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.10,0:01:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:16.20,0:01:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.70,0:01:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.60,0:01:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.40,0:01:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.20,0:01:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:02.90,0:02:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 一萬圓也好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.30,0:02:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錢借給你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:08.30,0:02:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房子和傢俱都被拿去抵擋了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:12.30,0:02:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過我一定會還你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:13.60,0:02:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 祐司
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:17.00,0:02:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你沒資格直呼我的名字
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.20,0:02:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:22.40,0:02:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 之前你們花了我多少錢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.40,0:02:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別說你已經忘記了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以說那又怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:33.10,0:02:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你現在是窮光蛋 咱們沒什麼好談的	
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.00,0:02:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前因爲你是有錢人家少爺纔跟你混的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:39.10,0:02:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這點都感覺不到 真白癡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:41.30,0:02:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白癡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:01.40,0:03:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.30,0:03:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着瞧吧 稻垣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.90,0:03:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已予受理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:43.70,0:03:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後的事 就由你自己抉擇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.70,0:03:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}扯開的線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.20,0:04:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.70,0:04:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:09.50,0:04:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將這紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.40,0:04:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:13.80,0:04:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:18.00,0:04:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.20,0:04:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:28.10,0:04:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:30.60,0:04:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.20,0:04:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.70,0:04:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死後靈魂將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.60,0:04:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無法前往極樂淨土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:46.90,0:04:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飽嘗痛楚與苦難
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.00,0:04:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永遠徘徊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:55.90,0:04:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也會下地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:23.00,0:05:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,過了三天 覺得怎樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.50,0:05:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰知道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.40,0:05:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你賭哪個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.50,0:05:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出這麼點兒押他不會解開繩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.20,0:05:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 這可不是鬧着玩啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.80,0:05:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:35.30,0:05:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個不懂得幽默的女人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.60,0:05:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽到了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.50,0:06:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鶇啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:12.70,0:06:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,步
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.50,0:06:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 吵死了啊 混蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:58.40,0:07:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉啊 百忙之中打擾你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:02.50,0:07:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感覺怎樣 久違的老家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:05.10,0:07:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老樣子氣氛凝重令人不快啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:08.00,0:07:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稻垣總編
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.60,0:07:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你也留下的話當個副編不成問題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.20,0:07:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能當個副編啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.80,0:07:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,銷量不錯啊 最近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.50,0:07:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an1}國際慈善家的真面目\N和平黨片岡洋三的\N紙醉金迷的人生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:21.90,0:07:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拖福 還湊合吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.00,0:07:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大型經濟政治雜誌什麼時候墮落成醜聞雜誌了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.50,0:07:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你還真是個口不饒人的傢伙啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:30.90,0:07:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,國際慈善家的真面目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:33.20,0:07:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和平黨片岡洋三的紙醉金迷的人生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:37.00,0:07:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是揭發了事實真相
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.50,0:07:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說由於這篇報道片岡被逮捕了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.20,0:07:44.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能得個警視總監賞了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.40,0:07:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是你能比這個寫得更好？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不會回來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是爲了這個事情叫你來的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.60,0:07:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是想找些快樂的舊事聊聊吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.40,0:07:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有工作想交給你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.80,0:08:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幫我盯着國民黨的河原崎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.50,0:08:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和背景複雜的的女人在交往
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.00,0:08:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保證給你不錯的報酬
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:15.30,0:08:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用來威脅的把柄啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.90,0:08:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用詞可要小心點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:18.60,0:08:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是作爲最後的王牌而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.10,0:08:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然我們得到了內部消息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.50,0:08:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,河原崎他很謹慎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.30,0:08:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用堂堂正正的方法無法揭露他的罪行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你會幫這個忙的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.50,0:08:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不想趟這混水啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.20,0:08:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:35.90,0:08:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把現有的資料準備一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.30,0:08:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,期限是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.30,0:08:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一週以內
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.20,0:08:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.90,0:08:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能搞到的證據不足
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.20,0:08:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就適當誇張一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.00,0:08:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,編造嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.00,0:08:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是編造的也有不錯的效果
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.20,0:08:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到哪去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.70,0:09:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就算再窘迫也是個記者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.10,0:09:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別把人看扁了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.20,0:09:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柴田
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.30,0:09:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要耍花招的話你自己想辦法去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.90,0:09:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別裝酷了 我可把你全調查清楚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.20,0:09:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是在幹把偷拍的照片賣給本人這種事嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.70,0:09:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐回來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:17.40,0:09:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,過去的朋友在拜託你幫忙啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.70,0:09:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,連我也想威脅嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.60,0:09:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這可不是威脅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.40,0:09:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墮落了啊 稻垣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.60,0:09:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柴田
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.50,0:09:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是和以前一樣沒毅力啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.20,0:09:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還以爲貧窮的生活會讓你成熟呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還給你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.00,0:09:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那種傢伙可出不了頭啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:48.00,0:09:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎麼樣都無所謂啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:50.20,0:09:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.60,0:09:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們的目標更重要呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:54.70,0:09:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種天真的披露報道沒可能吸引讀者吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.40,0:09:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不錯嘛 一臉看上去就不像好人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:04.80,0:10:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼天氣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.70,0:10:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次再闖進來就把你送到警察局去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:09.30,0:10:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽到沒有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓我見下稻垣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要見的話就事先預約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.30,0:10:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能預約我早預約了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:15.80,0:10:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 滾遠點 人渣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.50,0:10:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這混蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.30,0:10:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要幹什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.30,0:10:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找稲垣有事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.00,0:10:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前也是在那工作的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:43.30,0:10:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟稻垣一起啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.40,0:10:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想和我聊聊嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稻垣他人怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.50,0:10:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,討厭的傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.50,0:11:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:03.00,0:11:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,片岡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:03.90,0:11:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,片岡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:08.30,0:11:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.80,0:11:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎 難怪感覺在哪裏見過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:13.70,0:11:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是片岡洋三的兒子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:15.90,0:11:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲受賄而被捕的那個和平黨的那個片岡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:20.50,0:11:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而他被搞得身敗名裂就是因爲你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:23.20,0:11:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你還吸過毒吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.10,0:11:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是捏造的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:28.90,0:11:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本沒吸過毒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.30,0:11:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被陷害的 被稻垣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.40,0:11:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,確實在警察進行藥物檢查時是陰性
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:42.40,0:11:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那篇報道中也說證據確鑿啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.40,0:11:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本沒有那回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.70,0:11:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那傢伙 是稻垣他隨便亂寫出來的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:52.10,0:11:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然立刻登出了修正啓事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.60,0:11:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那時老爸的受賄事實已被公開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:57.90,0:11:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,造成了相當大的輿論
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.60,0:12:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因爲都被重大事件分散了注意嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:03.20,0:12:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修正啓事我也完全沒有注意到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:07.10,0:12:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稻垣那傢伙全都算計到了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:09.60,0:12:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,財產都被查封 家人也都變得四分五裂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是那個傢伙的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:15.90,0:12:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了加罪於爸爸 稻垣甚至連我們家人也利用了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:20.30,0:12:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,決不能讓這傢伙逍遙地活着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.90,0:12:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我決不能放過奪走我一切的這傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:25.90,0:12:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:27.00,0:12:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.40,0:12:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要殺了他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:32.40,0:12:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼做你也只會被當作是笨蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.10,0:12:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:38.80,0:12:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以委託了別人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:45.40,0:12:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,委託
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:48.30,0:12:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,復仇解決不了任何問題的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:50.40,0:12:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的心情我理解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.90,0:12:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就把那份能量用在自己身上吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:54.10,0:12:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,化悲憤爲力量啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再考慮下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.70,0:13:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在拋棄人生還太早了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:02.80,0:13:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.60,0:13:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 等下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.20,0:13:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請他喝飲料反而還受他氣 真不划算啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.90,0:13:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,委託殺人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:19.80,0:13:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是現在的他怎麼可能有那種錢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.60,0:13:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:50.50,0:13:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做的真不錯啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:51.70,0:13:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.80,0:13:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常了不起啊 小鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:55.20,0:13:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個都可以拿到我們店裏去賣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.70,0:14:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是照着店長教的做而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.90,0:14:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸會高興的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:04.00,0:14:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那樣就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.90,0:14:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:19.70,0:14:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:21.50,0:14:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纔開始呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.70,0:14:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洋子和梓我帶走了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:26.80,0:14:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快點快點 到你家去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:28.70,0:14:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.70,0:14:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼媽媽 我們走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.00,0:14:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍微振作點啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:33.80,0:14:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是很精神嗎 笨蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.50,0:14:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果那傢伙真的委託了別人的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.00,0:14:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啊 在這種時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.70,0:14:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 我又看到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:53.60,0:14:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼 真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.10,0:14:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這次是在哪裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:56.60,0:14:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 在個熱鬧的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:59.30,0:15:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,熱鬧的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:00.40,0:15:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼標誌性的東西嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:02.90,0:15:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快餐 藍寶石
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:06.60,0:15:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼說來果然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.90,0:15:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 不好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:11.80,0:15:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這邊這邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:19.10,0:15:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稻垣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.60,0:15:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 你是誰啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:28.10,0:15:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是片岡洋三的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:30.50,0:15:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你的錯 我家都變的不像樣子了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:33.50,0:15:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像樣子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:34.90,0:15:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蠢蛋 理所當然的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:37.50,0:15:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰叫你老爸做了那麼多壞事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:40.60,0:15:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怪就怪你爸去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:42.60,0:15:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了揭發我老爸 竟然利用我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:46.50,0:15:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:48.40,0:15:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這混蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:59.40,0:16:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:02.70,0:16:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼我們走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.50,0:16:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是幹什麼的啊 那個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:08.40,0:16:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 沒事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:11.00,0:16:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找錯對手了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:13.00,0:16:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稻垣可是空手道入段的高手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:18.90,0:16:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你委託的是地獄少女吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:25.10,0:16:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:26.80,0:16:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,礙事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要緊了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.30,0:16:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經沒事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.00,0:16:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,店長先回店裏去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:35.80,0:16:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還沒收拾吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:37.50,0:16:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係啦 我去幫你拿杯水
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:41.90,0:16:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:51.00,0:16:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:56.10,0:16:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最初我是半信半疑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.10,0:17:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,覺得不可能存在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.70,0:17:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卻是存在的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:03.90,0:17:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女是真的存在的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:07.40,0:17:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣的女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:10.90,0:17:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪遇見的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:12.80,0:17:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.90,0:17:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你委託她殺了稻垣嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:25.60,0:17:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是現在卻是你自己行動
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:28.70,0:17:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,復仇明明是委託地獄少女 怎麼還
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.60,0:17:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.10,0:17:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,契約的信物
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:39.20,0:17:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要解開這根線 契約就成立了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.20,0:17:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:47.60,0:17:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:49.50,0:17:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎 還來得及啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:53.10,0:17:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 不要解開線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.80,0:17:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去讓稻垣謝罪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:58.20,0:18:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稻垣死了也不能解決任何問題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:00.50,0:18:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要將他所作的事情都公開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.10,0:18:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,報道我來寫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:05.50,0:18:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你千萬不要解開線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:08.00,0:18:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:17.90,0:18:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.70,0:18:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你是什麼人爲何要做這種事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.80,0:18:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我敢斷言
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:27.10,0:18:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你 是錯的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:48.20,0:18:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去了 一個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.40,0:18:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是兩個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:51.70,0:18:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯 和一個十分妖豔的女人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:54.40,0:18:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:55.20,0:18:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 去我們店吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.70,0:18:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 好啊 那走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:00.00,0:19:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:01.70,0:19:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我們當什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:02.10,0:19:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:16.50,0:19:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊 真是個偏僻的地方啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:19.80,0:19:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪點不是很好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.00,0:19:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:24.00,0:19:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了哦 請打開吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:26.80,0:19:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:30.90,0:19:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎 怎麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:41.90,0:19:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一身酒臭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:19.80,0:20:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,淪落的新聞界!\N真 實 的 內 幕!!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:23.20,0:20:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓我出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.20,0:20:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快讓我從這出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:26.60,0:20:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫你們讓我出去啊 喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:28.30,0:20:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對自己所犯的罪有些懺悔了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:31.20,0:20:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罪 什麼罪啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:33.50,0:20:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是把被隱藏的真相公諸於世而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:36.50,0:20:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稱讚我還差不多 根本沒有理由把我稱爲罪人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.10,0:20:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 那就是說爲了真相不管做什麼都無所謂吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:45.50,0:20:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被揭露的真相纔是正義
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:47.80,0:20:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你所謂的新聞工作嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:50.80,0:20:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯 民衆所追求的就是名爲真相的轟動
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:55.80,0:20:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是在滿足民衆的那種慾望
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.30,0:20:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沒有錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:00.20,0:21:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他這麼說呢 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:05.60,0:21:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:09.10,0:21:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:17.70,0:21:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:36.60,0:21:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:43.20,0:21:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去哪裏啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:45.00,0:21:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把船開回去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:56.90,0:21:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:58.80,0:22:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:13.20,0:22:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開線了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:20.90,0:22:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:22.40,0:22:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在把一切公諸於衆又有什麼用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:25.20,0:22:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破碎的東西已經難以復原了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:29.50,0:22:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也有家人的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:31.80,0:22:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,應該明白吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:39.00,0:22:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,片岡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.80,0:23:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.50,0:23:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:22.00,0:23:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て　{\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:28.90,0:23:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ　{\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ　{\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:46.00,0:23:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:49.80,0:24:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:00.80,0:24:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:07.80,0:24:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.45,0:24:32.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:33.30,0:24:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:34.70,0:24:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井茜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:36.40,0:24:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個男人的行爲虛僞？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:40.50,0:24:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他完全沒有考慮我的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:43.60,0:24:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙只是爲了自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:46.00,0:24:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他其實覺得我這樣的差生還是不存在的好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:50.10,0:24:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:52.10,0:24:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那傢伙流放到地獄去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:55.30,0:24:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.97,0:25:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.97,0:25:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}零落的碎片
